Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection') vulnerability in GM Information Technologies MDO allows SQL Injection.<p>This issue affects MDO: through 20231229.&nbsp;

NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.

</p>

Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting') vulnerability in KC Group E-Commerce Software allows Reflected XSS.<p>This issue affects E-Commerce Software: through 20231123.&nbsp;

NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.

</p>
